  storyText: "The Blackwall\n\nA wall of red, living code that goes up forever. Voices whisper behind it.\n\nMirage: \"If I go through, it opens a crack for a moment. Or... I could stay with you. Forever.\"\n\n1. Let her go home.\n2. Tear the Wall wide open.\n3. Ask her to stay."
